  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8223aef8f28f4c119470386020d3c682, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lines_NPC1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: ProjectCook.Dialogue::ProjectCook.Dialogue.DialogueLinesSO
  fallback: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f6545fc893bb4d7d8252efea3b34539a, type: 2}
  lines:
  - key: greeting
    variants:
    - Wait, wasn't I just...?
    - That face really brings back memories... the look of someone trying their best.
  - key: hub
    variants:
    - Is there anything you want?
  - key: chat
    variants:
    - "You know, maybe everything happened a bit too fast... for you, for me, for
      all of us. But hey, I\u2019m right here now, and you\u2019re here with us too.
      So maybe, if you just \"stand still for a moment\", you might figure out what
      to do next. Or you could just take a \"seat\" somewhere around here and think
      it over."
    - "You know, it feels like I used to make that exact face you're making so many
      times, a long, long time ago. A really long time ago\u2014even though I don't
      even have a face."
  - key: give_item
    variants:
    - Honestly, I can't even remember the last time these things actually meant anything.
      So, just give it everything you've got.
    - Is there really anything better than having someone who is truly ready to do
      something for you? Right?
  - key: choice_chat
    variants:
    - chat
  - key: choice_bye
    variants:
    - See you around.
